---
import DocsLayout from "../../layouts/docs.astro";
---

<DocsLayout title="Airlock Gateway Client SDKs">
    <div class="space-y-8">
        <div>
            <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold">
                Gateway Client SDKs
            </h1>
            <p class="text-muted-foreground mt-2">
                Multi-language client libraries for the Airlock Integrations Gateway,
                built on the
                <a
                    href="https://harp-protocol.github.io"
                    target="_blank"
                    rel="noopener noreferrer"
                    class="text-link hover:underline">HARP protocol</a
                >.
            </p>
            <p class="text-muted-foreground mt-2 text-sm">
                For PAT-first auth, pre-generated pairing codes, and the full enforcer lifecycle, see the
                <a href="/docs/developer-guide" class="text-link hover:underline">Developer Guide</a>.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 mt-4">
            <a
                href="https://github.com/airlockapp/gateway-clients"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer"
                class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 rounded-full border border-border/50 bg-muted/30 text-sm font-medium text-foreground hover:bg-muted/60 transition-colors"
            >
                <svg
                    xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
                    class="w-4 h-4"
                    viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                    fill="currentColor"
                    ><path
                        d="M12 0C5.37 0 0 5.37 0 12c0 5.31 3.435 9.795 8.205 11.385.6.105.825-.255.825-.57 0-.285-.015-1.23-.015-2.235-3.015.555-3.795-.735-4.035-1.41-.135-.345-.72-1.41-1.23-1.695-.42-.225-1.02-.78-.015-.795.945-.015 1.62.87 1.845 1.23 1.08 1.815 2.805 1.305 3.495.99.105-.78.42-1.305.765-1.605-2.67-.3-5.46-1.335-5.46-5.925 0-1.305.465-2.385 1.23-3.225-.12-.3-.54-1.53.12-3.18 0 0 1.005-.315 3.3 1.23.96-.27 1.98-.405 3-.405s2.04.135 3 .405c2.295-1.56 3.3-1.23 3.3-1.23.66 1.65.24 2.88.12 3.18.765.84 1.23 1.905 1.23 3.225 0 4.605-2.805 5.625-5.475 5.925.435.375.81 1.095.81 2.22 0 1.605-.015 2.895-.015 3.3 0 .315.225.69.825.57A12.02 12.02 0 0 0 24 12c0-6.63-5.37-12-12-12Z"
                    ></path></svg
                >
                GitHub Repository
                <svg
                    xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
                    class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-muted-foreground"
                    viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                    fill="none"
                    stroke="currentColor"
                    stroke-width="2"
                    stroke-linecap="round"
                    stroke-linejoin="round"
                    ><path
                        d="M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"
                    ></path><polyline points="15 3 21 3 21 9"
                    ></polyline><line x1="10" y1="14" x2="21" y2="3"
                    ></line></svg
                >
            </a>
            <a
                href="https://harp-protocol.github.io"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer"
                class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 rounded-full border border-border/50 bg-muted/30 text-sm font-medium text-foreground hover:bg-muted/60 transition-colors"
            >
                HARP Protocol
                <svg
                    xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
                    class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-muted-foreground"
                    viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                    fill="none"
                    stroke="currentColor"
                    stroke-width="2"
                    stroke-linecap="round"
                    stroke-linejoin="round"
                    ><path
                        d="M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"
                    ></path><polyline points="15 3 21 3 21 9"
                    ></polyline><line x1="10" y1="14" x2="21" y2="3"
                    ></line></svg
                >
            </a>
        </div>


        <div
            class="rounded-xl border border-indigo-500/30 bg-indigo-500/10 px-4 py-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground"
        >
            <strong class="text-foreground">Enterprise deployment.</strong>
            Configure integrations against your organization's Gateway at
            <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1 text-xs">https://&lt;your-gateway-host&gt;</code>
            and identity at
            <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1 text-xs">https://&lt;your-auth-host&gt;/realms/&lt;your-realm&gt;</code>.
            See the <a href="/docs/getting-started" class="text-link hover:underline">Getting started</a>
            and <a href="/docs/developer-guide" class="text-link hover:underline">Developer Guide</a>.
        </div>


        <!-- Overview -->
        <div class="prose dark:prose-invert max-w-none">
            <div
                class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-border/50 bg-muted/30"
            >
                <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                    All SDKs cover the <strong class="text-foreground"
                        >enforcer-side</strong
                    > Integrations Gateway API: artifact submission, decision polling,
                    exchange management, pairing (including pre-generated codes),
                    presence heartbeats, policies, and discovery. For user-scoped
                    calls, use a <strong class="text-foreground">Personal Access Token (PAT)</strong>
                    via the <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1">X-PAT</code> header (recommended for
                    CLIs/scripts), or a <strong class="text-foreground">Bearer JWT</strong> from the
                    Device Authorization Grant, together with your app credentials where required.
                </p>
                <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground mt-2">
                    Gateway base URL (your deployment):
                    <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1 text-xs">https://&lt;your-gateway-host&gt;</code>
                </p>
                <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground mt-2">
                    Recommended artifact type for command review flows:
                    <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1">command.review</code>
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- SDK Language Cards -->
        <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-6 flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="w-1.5 h-6 rounded-full bg-primary"></span>
                Choose Your Language
            </h2>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
                <!-- .NET -->
                <a href="/docs/sdk/dotnet" class="group block p-5 rounded-xl border border-border/50 bg-muted/20 hover:bg-muted/40 hover:border-purple-500/40 transition-all">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
                        <span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-purple-600/15 text-purple-500 text-sm font-bold group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">C#</span>
                        <div>
                            <h3 class="font-semibold text-foreground">.NET</h3>
                            <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">Airlock.Gateway.Sdk</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">.NET 8+ · NuGet · System.Text.Json</p>
                    <div class="mt-3 text-xs text-link group-hover:underline">View documentation →</div>
                </a>

                <!-- Python -->
                <a href="/docs/sdk/python" class="group block p-5 rounded-xl border border-border/50 bg-muted/20 hover:bg-muted/40 hover:border-yellow-500/40 transition-all">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
                        <span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-yellow-500/15 text-yellow-500 text-sm font-bold group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">Py</span>
                        <div>
                            <h3 class="font-semibold text-foreground">Python</h3>
                            <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">airlock-gateway</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">Python 3.9+ · asyncio · httpx</p>
                    <div class="mt-3 text-xs text-link group-hover:underline">View documentation →</div>
                </a>

                <!-- TypeScript -->
                <a href="/docs/sdk/typescript" class="group block p-5 rounded-xl border border-border/50 bg-muted/20 hover:bg-muted/40 hover:border-blue-500/40 transition-all">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
                        <span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-blue-500/15 text-blue-500 text-sm font-bold group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">TS</span>
                        <div>
                            <h3 class="font-semibold text-foreground">TypeScript</h3>
                            <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">@airlockapp/gateway-sdk</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">Node.js 18+ · zero-dependency · native fetch</p>
                    <div class="mt-3 text-xs text-link group-hover:underline">View documentation →</div>
                </a>

                <!-- Go -->
                <a href="/docs/sdk/go" class="group block p-5 rounded-xl border border-border/50 bg-muted/20 hover:bg-muted/40 hover:border-cyan-500/40 transition-all">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
                        <span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-cyan-500/15 text-cyan-500 text-sm font-bold group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">Go</span>
                        <div>
                            <h3 class="font-semibold text-foreground">Go</h3>
                            <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">airlock</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">Go 1.21+ · net/http · x/crypto</p>
                    <div class="mt-3 text-xs text-link group-hover:underline">View documentation →</div>
                </a>

                <!-- Rust -->
                <a href="/docs/sdk/rust" class="group block p-5 rounded-xl border border-border/50 bg-muted/20 hover:bg-muted/40 hover:border-orange-500/40 transition-all">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
                        <span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-orange-600/15 text-orange-500 text-sm font-bold group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">Rs</span>
                        <div>
                            <h3 class="font-semibold text-foreground">Rust</h3>
                            <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">airlock-gateway</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">Rust 1.75+ · reqwest · tokio</p>
                    <div class="mt-3 text-xs text-link group-hover:underline">View documentation →</div>
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- API Surface -->
        <div class="max-w-none">
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="w-1.5 h-6 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>
                Gateway API Surface
            </h2>
            <table class="w-full text-sm border-collapse">
                <thead>
                    <tr class="border-b border-border/50">
                        <th class="text-left py-2 font-medium w-20">Method</th>
                        <th class="text-left py-2 font-medium">Endpoint</th>
                        <th class="text-left py-2 font-medium">Description</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody class="text-muted-foreground">
                    <!-- Integrations discovery -->
                    <tr class="border-b border-border/30"
                        ><td class="py-2"><span class="inline-block rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold bg-emerald-500/15 text-emerald-500">GET</span></td
                        ><td class="py-2"><code class="rounded bg-muted px-1">/v1/integrations/discovery</code></td
                        ><td class="py-2">Discover IdP configuration (device auth setup)</td></tr
                    >
                    <!-- Discovery -->
                    <tr class="border-b border-border/30"
                        ><td class="py-2"><span class="inline-block rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold bg-emerald-500/15 text-emerald-500">GET</span></td
                        ><td class="py-2"><code class="rounded bg-muted px-1">/echo</code></td
                        ><td class="py-2">Gateway discovery and health check</td></tr
                    >
                    <!-- Artifacts -->
                    <tr class="border-b border-border/30"
                        ><td class="py-2"><span class="inline-block rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold bg-blue-500/15 text-blue-500">POST</span></td
                        ><td class="py-2"><code class="rounded bg-muted px-1">/v1/artifacts</code></td
                        ><td class="py-2">Submit an artifact for approval</td></tr
                    >
                    <!-- Exchanges -->
                    <tr class="border-b border-border/30"
                        ><td class="py-2"><span class="inline-block rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold bg-emerald-500/15 text-emerald-500">GET</span></td
                        ><td class="py-2"><code class="rounded bg-muted px-1">/v1/exchanges/&#123;requestId&#125;</code></td
                        ><td class="py-2">Get exchange status</td></tr
                    >
                    <tr class="border-b border-border/30"
                        ><td class="py-2"><span class="inline-block rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold bg-emerald-500/15 text-emerald-500">GET</span></td
                        ><td class="py-2"><code class="rounded bg-muted px-1">/v1/exchanges/&#123;requestId&#125;/wait</code></td
                        ><td class="py-2">Long-poll for a decision</td></tr
                    >
                    <tr class="border-b border-border/30"
                        ><td class="py-2"><span class="inline-block rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold bg-blue-500/15 text-blue-500">POST</span></td
                        ><td class="py-2"><code class="rounded bg-muted px-1">/v1/exchanges/&#123;requestId&#125;/withdraw</code></td
                        ><td class="py-2">Withdraw a pending exchange</td></tr
                    >
                    <!-- Pairing -->
                    <tr class="border-b border-border/30"
                        ><td class="py-2"><span class="inline-block rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold bg-blue-500/15 text-blue-500">POST</span></td
                        ><td class="py-2"><code class="rounded bg-muted px-1">/v1/pairing/initiate</code></td
                        ><td class="py-2">Start a new pairing session</td></tr
                    >
                    <tr class="border-b border-border/30"
                        ><td class="py-2"><span class="inline-block rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold bg-emerald-500/15 text-emerald-500">GET</span></td
                        ><td class="py-2"><code class="rounded bg-muted px-1">/v1/pairing/&#123;nonce&#125;/status</code></td
                        ><td class="py-2">Poll pairing status</td></tr
                    >
                    <tr class="border-b border-border/30"
                        ><td class="py-2"><span class="inline-block rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold bg-blue-500/15 text-blue-500">POST</span></td
                        ><td class="py-2"><code class="rounded bg-muted px-1">/v1/pairing/revoke</code></td
                        ><td class="py-2">Revoke an active pairing</td></tr
                    >
                    <tr class="border-b border-border/30"
                        ><td class="py-2"><span class="inline-block rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold bg-blue-500/15 text-blue-500">POST</span></td
                        ><td class="py-2"><code class="rounded bg-muted px-1">/v1/pairing/pre-generate</code></td
                        ><td class="py-2">Pre-generate a pairing code (30-minute TTL)</td></tr
                    >
                    <tr class="border-b border-border/30"
                        ><td class="py-2"><span class="inline-block rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold bg-blue-500/15 text-blue-500">POST</span></td
                        ><td class="py-2"><code class="rounded bg-muted px-1">/v1/pairing/claim</code></td
                        ><td class="py-2">Claim a pre-generated pairing code</td></tr
                    >
                    <!-- Presence -->
                    <tr class="border-b border-border/30"
                        ><td class="py-2"><span class="inline-block rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold bg-blue-500/15 text-blue-500">POST</span></td
                        ><td class="py-2"><code class="rounded bg-muted px-1">/v1/presence/heartbeat</code></td
                        ><td class="py-2">Send a presence heartbeat</td></tr
                    >
                    <!-- DND Policies -->
                    <tr class="border-b border-border/30"
                        ><td class="py-2"><span class="inline-block rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold bg-emerald-500/15 text-emerald-500">GET</span></td
                        ><td class="py-2"><code class="rounded bg-muted px-1">/v1/policy/dnd/effective</code></td
                        ><td class="py-2">Fetch effective DND policies for an enforcer/workspace/session</td></tr
                    >
                    <!-- Consent -->
                    <tr class="border-b border-border/30"
                        ><td class="py-2"><span class="inline-block rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold bg-emerald-500/15 text-emerald-500">GET</span></td
                        ><td class="py-2"><code class="rounded bg-muted px-1">/v1/consents/check</code></td
                        ><td class="py-2">Check user consent for an enforcer app</td></tr
                    >
                </tbody>
            </table>
        </div>
    </div>
</DocsLayout>
